This project combines features of, and adapts data and artwork from, the
following projects. That material is NOT public domain: it remains under the
MIT License, and its copyright notices are kept below as that license
requires.

EdBindings — https://github.com/ghorsey/EdBindings
  Copyright (c) 2021 Geoff
  Used for: the bindings table design, action names (ActionMappings.json),
  device control label mappings (DeviceMappings), and bindED variable naming.

EDRefCard 2 — https://github.com/brammmers/edrefcard2
  (a fork of EDRefCard — https://github.com/richardbuckle/EDRefCard)
  Copyright (c) 2017 Richard Buckle
  EDRefCard is derived with permission from code originally developed by
  CMDR jgm.
  Used for: reference card design, command metadata (controlsData.py),
  supported device definitions and control layouts (bindingsData.py), and
  controller artwork.

EliteCustomButtonNames — https://github.com/EDCD/EliteCustomButtonNames
  Copyright (c) 2025 Richard Buckle
  Used for: device button-name maps (.buttonMap files).

Bindwing — https://github.com/derrickmehaffy/bindwing
  Copyright (c) 2026 Derrick Mehaffy
  Used for: live WebHID/Gamepad input handling approach.

bindsmith — https://github.com/bullwinkle3000/bindsmith
  Copyright (c) 2026 Andrew Langton
  Used for: blank action template and device re-targeting approach.

EDBV — https://github.com/DRA6N/EDBV
  Copyright (c) 2025 DRA6N
  Used for: action name/area/category table (mappings.edbv).

EliteBinding — https://github.com/trasa/EliteBinding
  Copyright 2025 Tony Rasa
  Used for: short action labels (naming.json) and a sample binds test file.

EDRefKB — https://github.com/RealOfficialTurf/EDRefKB
  Copyright (c) 2022 RealOfficialTurf
  Used for: Elite keyboard key names and action labels.

elite-dangerous-binds-editor
(https://github.com/mholtmanns/elite-dangerous-binds-editor) is released
into the public domain under the Unlicense and needs no notice; it is
credited here for its editing ideas.

